# Beginner users

Desktop users are beginners. They do not use a terminal and do not know MCP, paths, protocols, or CLI commands.

This is locked in `docs/zh-CN/product-boundary.md` and `docs/product-boundary.md`. Follow it for every feature and every user-visible string.

- Say the problem in one sentence with words they already have: project, tool, cannot connect, needs a key.
- Button labels name the change they will see. Do not say “Fix” when the click cannot clear the problem.
- After a click, show the result where they clicked. If the warning stays, say why in one plain sentence and what to tap next.
- Commands, file paths, and raw English errors are never the only explanation.
